   121	> irreducible component of `A_F` that is the image of a dicritical. Then the
   122	> projective model of `D_l` is rational, `D_l` has exactly **one** place at
   123	> infinity, and `D~_l ≅ A^1`. Under `H2` this is `H3`, and it needs **no**
   124	> trivial dicritical.
