xmodel/n20-escape-hostile-review-sol56-20260901.md:190:The safe version of Theorem 7.A is therefore: **assuming H2 and, for contradiction, a dicritical with \(\mu_0=1\), every dicritical has zero excess \(k_l\).** N20:491 and 569–583 suppress these ambient hypotheses; N20:602–606 correctly restores them. No general Keller-map “no excess” theorem is licensed.
